{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はSamuraiELOさんの\n撮影でした！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ先輩、伊織、ひなちま、まりかさん、井上さんと撮影だったよー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新鮮な組み合わせ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回は今年流行る、流行ってる\nメンズ服について話したり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろなアイテムのアリナシ判別したよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファッションって難しいです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女の子の流行とかファッションとかにも疎いのに、男の子ってなるともっと難しい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だけど、こうやって\nファッション誌のお仕事をさせてもらうと\nそういうこともお勉強になるから\n嬉しいです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売は8月24日です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みてねー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと、今日わかったことは\n井上さんの走り方のクセがすごい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/09/8288238/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/09/8288238/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/09/8288238/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/09/8288238/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の朝、名古屋から東京に戻ってきたんですが今日の名古屋は38度だったんですよね？。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごいあつい！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北海道でさえとんでもない気温になっていて、地球に住んでるものとして不安になります。。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたも午前中は撮影で\n20歳になってからグラビア撮影は\n初めてなのでドキドキ！(｡-_-｡)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いい天気だといいな～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは今日はこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに聞きたいことあるんだった！\nまた聞きます！"}],"source":"archive"}